des available making each run unique and interesting<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/0a36668b848bd838246f69fa74b62a60.webp?t=1702338161\" width=316 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/57f9f4619f3a08787e50a8b27da469df.poster.avif?t=1702338161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/57f9f4619f3a08787e50a8b27da469df.webm?t=1702338161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/57f9f4619f3a08787e50a8b27da469df.mp4?t=1702338161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With a roguelite progression system, no run is ever a fail. Gather more points and unlock new upgrades and weapons to add to the pool to create overpowered builds!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/47d2b47168cefa83e75adf9f1d1d623f.webp?t=1702338161\" width=316 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/d2d4b00b5b611c2c755b90dde11cb348.poster.avif?t=1702338161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/d2d4b00b5b611c2c755b90dde11cb348.webm?t=1702338161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704660/extras/d2d4b00b5b611c2c755b90dde11cb348.mp4?t=1702338161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade your build by unlocking new astronauts and ships. Each astronaut has 